--TEST--
A sync cookie is bytes the server wrote, so `Changes::cookie()` returns `tainted bytes` and a plain `bytes` does not take it — ADR 0278 § 11 and `rule:security/tainted-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Sync {
    public static function cookieOf(Core\Ldap\Changes $changes): bytes {
        bytes $cookie = $changes->cookie();
        return $cookie;
    }
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0401]: expected `bytes`, found `tainted bytes`
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
